21:12.730 --> 21:14.300
Nobuchi.

21:14.300 --> 21:15.840
Here.

21:15.840 --> 21:17.360
Hashimoto.

21:17.360 --> 21:18.260
Here.

21:19.230 --> 21:20.980
Fukazawa.

21:20.980 --> 21:22.720
Here.

21:22.720 --> 21:24.370
Hoshino.

21:24.370 --> 21:25.480
Here.

21:29.480 --> 21:30.060
